<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 13px; font-weight: var(--weight-label); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; gap: 14px">Featured work</p>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--line)"></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-right: 8px">October 2026</span>
<span style="border: 1px solid var(--outline); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 13px">Accessibility</span>
<span style="border: 1px solid var(--outline); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 13px">CSS</span>
<span style="border: 1px solid var(--outline); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 13px">Web standards</span>
<span style="border: 1px solid var(--outline); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 13px">HDR</span>
</div>
<h2 id="cs-title" style="margin: 0; color: var(--display); max-width: 900px; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 56px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.08; text-wrap: balance">A "reduce brightness spikes" setting for the web</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 760px; font-size: 19px; color: var(--text-muted); text-wrap: pretty">Proposed a new user preference, like <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>, to stop HDR images from flashing far brighter than the page around them. Root-caused a real incident from the file's bytes, built a live demo, and filed it with the CSS Working Group.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 28px">
<a href="https://upadhyayprakash.github.io/hdr-brightness-a11y/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 24px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600">Read the proposal<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"></path><path d="M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a>
<a href="https://upadhyayprakash.github.io/hdr-brightness-a11y/demo/" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; padding: 4px 0">
<span style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 1px solid var(--text-muted); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"></path><path d="M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span>Live demo</a>
<a href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14616" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; padding: 4px 0">
<span style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 1px solid var(--text-muted); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"></path><path d="M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span>CSSWG #14616</a>
</div>
</section>

<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 48px 72px">

<aside class="toc-aside" aria-labelledby="toc-title" style="flex: 1 1 240px; max-width: 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<p id="toc-title" style="margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted)">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16"></path><path d="M4 12h11"></path><path d="M4 18h7"></path></svg>
On this page</p>
<nav aria-labelledby="toc-title" class="toc" data-toc>
<div class="toc__track" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="toc__progress" aria-hidden="true" data-toc-progress></div>
<div class="toc__bike" aria-hidden="true" data-toc-bike><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><g class="toc__wheel" style="transform-origin: 9px 26px" data-toc-wheel><circle cx="9" cy="26" r="7.5"></circle><path d="M9 18.5v15M2.5 22.25l13 7.5M2.5 29.75l13-7.5" stroke-width="0.9"></path></g><g class="toc__wheel" style="transform-origin: 31px 26px" data-toc-wheel><circle cx="31" cy="26" r="7.5"></circle><path d="M31 18.5v15M24.5 22.25l13 7.5M24.5 29.75l13-7.5" stroke-width="0.9"></path></g><path d="M9 26l9 0l-3.5-11.5L9 26M18 26l9-11M14.5 14.5h12.5M27 15l4 11M27 15l1.5-4.5M26 10.5h5M12 13.5h5"></path></svg></div>
<ol class="toc__list">
<li><a href="#moment" class="toc__link" data-toc-link="moment" aria-current="location"><span class="toc__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>The moment</a></li>
<li><a href="#investigation" class="toc__link" data-toc-link="investigation"><span class="toc__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>Investigation</a></li>
<li><a href="#built" class="toc__link" data-toc-link="built"><span class="toc__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>What I built</a></li>
<li><a href="#proposal" class="toc__link" data-toc-link="proposal"><span class="toc__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>The proposal</a></li>
<li><a href="#outcome" class="toc__link" data-toc-link="outcome"><span class="toc__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>Outcome so far</a></li>
<li><a href="#learnings" class="toc__link" data-toc-link="learnings"><span class="toc__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>Learnings</a></li>
</ol>
